    <h1>Legal T&amp;C</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-colo=
r: #998DD9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p local-id=3D"6f1174b9-dc68-4c04-a978-4eeb889287af">Fortra Review Complete=
 11.2025</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"2956c45a-64c3-4aea-8b97-3a49443ac220" id=3D"LegalT&amp;C-No=
n-partnerquoteLanguage"><strong>Non-partner</strong> quote Language</h2>
<p local-id=3D"478a4c6a-5b5d-4670-b176-52837fb7fe70">The following language=
 should be the T&amp;C=E2=80=99s for all solution groups.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"47787b61-401b-41b6-9e06-597e97445439">&nbsp;This Quote is su=
bject to the terms and conditions set forth in the Fortra Master Solutions =
Agreement and applicable Solution Specific Schedule(s) located at <a class=
=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?=
url=3Dhttp%3A%2F%2Fwww.fortra.com%2Flegal&amp;data=3D05%7C02%7Cleah.guenthe=
r%40fortra.com%7C6822a5e5a944419272a808de1288b711%7Cca81e23b350945eea9983e3=
46acf274d%7C0%7C0%7C638968575563865223%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1h=
cGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%=
3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=3D9dZkfPqWo%2FIjm6j07wgno%2BquPm%2Fp0XH1%2FG3X=
7VR5n0U%3D&amp;reserved=3D0" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>www.fortra.com/legal</u></=
a>&nbsp;</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"194d0711-cbfb-4880-848f-3fe8e6d3d7c4" id=3D"LegalT&amp;C-Pa=
rtnerQuoteRequirements">Partner Quote Requirements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"818c7d79-2152-4f7f-b17c-0fb5cbb0a075">We need 2 partner quot=
e types: (1) MSP and (2) all other partners.</p>
<p>If the Billing Account on the quote is a MSP Partner, then use T&amp;C e=
qual =E2=80=9CThis quote is subject to the Partner agreement between the pa=
rties.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p>If the Billing Account on the quote is a Partner of a type other than MS=
P, then use =E2=80=9CThe partner will pass through the terms at <a class=3D=
"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"http://fortra.com/l=
egal" rel=3D"nofollow">http://fortra.com/legal</a> to their customer.=E2=80=
=9D</p>
<p>If the Billing Account on the quote is anything else use standard Fortra=
 T&amp;C text.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"c0671d9f-368d-466a-a0e3-4a3cafe92579"><strong>Quote Terms an=
d Conditions Language: </strong>Reach out to legal to verify whether differ=
ent partner types (especially MSPs) require unique terms and conditions lan=
guage or if a single "partner" scenario is sufficient for quotes. (Heather)=
.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"3415e7a8-4c11-47c1-99b0-b5b8626fae3a" id=3D"LegalT&amp;C-Ex=
ceptiontoquoteLanguage">Exception to quote Language</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d3c1036e-c510-42bc-b8af-fdff3a5e5882"><a class=3D"confluence=
-userlink user-mention" data-account-id=3D"5ff7490a692b790110222e39" href=
=3D"https://helpsystems.atlassian.net/wiki/people/5ff7490a692b790110222e39?=
ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data-linked-resource-id=3D"15433917" da=
ta-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://helpsystems.atlassian.net/wiki">Mandy Lopez</a> <a cl=
ass=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-account-id=3D"62abca32188d080=
06fe3b315" href=3D"https://helpsystems.atlassian.net/wiki/people/62abca3218=
8d08006fe3b315?ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"15435467" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=
=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://helpsystems.atlassian.net/wiki">Cass=
ie Tusler</a> can you put here what your expectation is of managing T&amp;C=
 language should be for Salesforce?</p>
<p local-id=3D"4a1e788c-f4b4-4968-b3a8-d0704bf7eaca">Who can override?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"556b8870-f4d1-42cc-84f7-598b68020209">
<li local-id=3D"6d916ee2-177b-45d9-bdf5-8d0076dd4cd3">
<p local-id=3D"c41cda56-8dc9-4865-979b-d84bec2e408c">Customer Ops Manager a=
nd above</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"506c508c-4d7f-4bc9-99f3-ac44483dc8f7">What fields are needed=
 and in what entity area?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"790498ae-114d-4b9e-9c60-cd0a6ae5c6b7">
<li local-id=3D"0fceb04e-3731-4fa5-9cbd-1906244329cb">
<p local-id=3D"c05b822d-a470-4e2f-a55b-d42a68978183">We=E2=80=99ve given Co=
astal field names/functionality to add onto</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2a857abd-54f7-479c-afd3-eaf7c78b9d89">What functionality/aut=
omation should take place?</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"08bc82e0-0a7e-4810-936d-1fc561035cf6" id=3D"LegalT&amp;C-Se=
rvices/TermoraddedLanguage">Services / Term or added Language</h2>
